t count 2 where Alex is not booked\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-31.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The footer shows 'Join waitlist' and \\\"You'd be #3\\\"\",\n      \"when\": \"Class Detail is opened\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Sessions where Alex is Booked and where Alex is Waitlisted #2\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-31.3\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The footers show 'Cancel booking' with \\\"You're booked\\\" and 'Leave waitlist' with \\\"You're #2 on the waitlist\\\" respectively\",\n      \"when\": \"Each Class Detail is opened\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A session with status 'Cancelled by studio'\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-31.4\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The footer button is shown disabled with reason text 'Cancelled by studio'\",\n      \"when\": \"Class Detail is opened\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Class Detail screen shall show an action footer with 'Book this class' and 'X spots left' when not booked with spots, 'Join waitlist' and \\\"You'd be #N\\\" when not booked and full, 'Cancel booking' in destructive style and \\\"You're booked\\\" when Booked, 'Leave waitlist' and \\\"You're #N on the waitlist\\\" when Waitlisted, and a disabled button with reason text when the session has started, is cancelled by the studio or is outside the booking window.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-31\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-2\",\n     \"I-3\",\n     \"I-4\",\n     \"ASM-23\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Alex is Booked on a session starting in 90 minutes\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-32.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"A confirmation dialog is displayed containing the message \\\"Late cancellation — this counts as a missed class.\\\"\",\n      \"when\": \"The user activates 'Cancel booking'\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Alex is Booked on a session starting in 3 hours\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-32.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"A confirmation dialog is displayed without the late-cancellation message\",\n      \"when\": \"The user activates 'Cancel booking'\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Alex late-cancelled a session\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-32.3\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The row is shown with the badge 'Late cancel'\",\n      \"when\": \"The user opens My Bookings Past tab\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"When Alex chooses to cancel a booking, the app shall open a confirmation dialog that, when the session starts in less than 2 hours, shows the warning \\\"Late cancellation — this counts as a missed class.\\\" in warning style.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-32\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-4\",\n     \"ASM-3\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Alex is Booked on 'Power HIIT' 18:00–18:45 and opens Class Detail for an 18:30 Spin session\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-33.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The error message \\\"You're already booked for Power HIIT at 18:00–18:45.\\\" is displayed\",\n      \"when\": \"The user activates 'Book this class'\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Class Detail shows 'Book this class' and the session becomes full in storage before the tap\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-33.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The availability block is refreshed to show the full state and the footer shows 'Join waitlist'\",\n      \"when\": \"The user activates 'Book this class'\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"If booking from Class Detail is rejected, then the app shall show the rule's message (the overlap message naming the conflicting class or the 10-class limit message), and when the reason is that the class became full it shall refresh availability and offer 'Join waitlist'.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-33\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-4\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A Schedule c